<title>USA: Chicago Rivet raises dividend, splits stock.</title>
<headline>Chicago Rivet raises dividend, splits stock.</headline>
<dateline>NAPERVILLE, Ill. 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chicago Rivet &amp; Machine Co said Monday its board authorized a two-for-one stock split and raised its annual dividend.</p>
<p>The dividend was raised 20 percent to $0.36 a share on a pre-split basis. The cash dividend is payable Sept 19 to shareholders of record Sept 5.  </p>
<p>Under the stock split, the additional shares of stock will be issued Sept 19 to shareholders of record Sept 5.</p>
<p>	 -- ((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
